                     that does not exist in the upstream repository (typo, or a commit removed or
                     never pushed upstream)
                     ↳ at https://github.com/getplumber-examples/plumber-example-critical/blob/main/.github/workflows/ci.yml#L41

                ↳ docs: https://getplumber.io/docs/cli/issues/ISSUE-707

